# The vendored skills must stay byte-identical to upstream.
#
# `sync:check` compares the files on disk against a fresh download and the tests
# verify each file against the digest in `assets/upstream.json`. Git's default
# `core.autocrlf` on Windows would rewrite every line ending on checkout, so
# those comparisons would fail on a Windows machine for a reason that has
# nothing to do with the plugin. LF is the only setting that keeps the vendored
# tree identical everywhere, and upstream already uses it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be line-ending translated or merged.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
